zolturi amara guard~
the Amara guard, Zolturi~
An amara is lurking waste-deep in the water.
~
   Zolturi is a lean Amara with small blue-grey scales.  Upright she stands a
bit over five feet tall.  Her hands and feet are large, and her long fingers
and toes are webbed.  Her 'feet' are much more like hands than human feet.  
Her face is long and narrow, and her ears have no external lobes.  They are
more or less ripples on the side of her skull surrounding two small holes.  
Her black eyes stay focused on you, not revealing any emotion or intention.  
~
