K H 0~
zyra~
Zyra~
Floating here effortlessly, Zyra eyes you knowingly.
~
   Long, graceful, and elegant.  Zyra is not unlike a princess among her
people.  Her blue-grey scales, which favor a subtle blue, glisten with flashes
of silver as the light dances across them.  Her long, webbed fingers and toes
gently keep her where she wishes in the water.  A knowing smile breaks her long
face as she looks at you.  A platinum amulet is the only adornment upon her
body.  Perhaps she has something you want?    
~
