N D 0~
demon grizltor alligator~
Grizltor~
A towering alligator like humanoid stands here guarding a fissure in the rock to the north.
~
   Grizltor twelve foot tall frame is a mix of alligator and grizzly bear.  
His arms and legs are that of a bear and his torso, head, and tail are that of
a giant alligator.  Smoke drifts off his smouldering fur as his towering frame
sways.  his powerful tail is used almost as a third leg, helping him stay on
his feet.  His giant scaled body has smears of crimson ichor in places.  
Glowing red eyes stare down a long gaping snout at you.  His forked tongue,
avoiding the many steely teeth, whips about, sampling the air.    
~
