structure she is half-feline, half -humanoid in appearance.  Her legs favor her
feline side, while her arms and hands favor her humanoid side, except for the
retractable claws.  Her face and head strongly resemble that of a cheetah, but
her eyes express exquisite wisdom and intelligence.  Her big tail whips around
slowly, lazily.  Her coat is a medium brown, with black encircled spots except
for her under-belly.    
